"Now the computer has to decide what the key means. It looks at three things: the key number, whether Shift is down, and the keyboard layout you have chosen. From these it picks a character. Key 4 with no Shift gives a. Key 4 with Shift gives A. As you saw in Lesson 2, every character has its own number: a is 97, and A is 65.": "65aa42898a2e",
